            {
              "text": "And (because) Hashem is merciful, He repeatedly forgives our sins and does not destroy us! Hashem, please save us and answer us when we call out to You!"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 0
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "(—בָּרְכוּ אֶת יְהוָה הַמְּבֹרָךְ The chazzan calls us to action and says to us:) We must make the world realize (by how we speak and how we conduct ourselves daily) that Hashem is the Source of all, and that everything He does is perfect and for the ultimate best."
